    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"OutboundRow.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a> instance initialized with the given key/value pair.",
      "translation": "创建一个使用给定键/值对初始化的<a href=\"OutboundRow.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping 中的类\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"OutboundRow.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a> from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.util 中\"><code>Map</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"OutboundRow.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping 中的类\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Put the given key/value pair into this <a href=\"OutboundRow.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a> and return this. Useful for chaining puts in a single\nexpression:\n\n<pre class=\"code\">row.append(\"a\", 1).append(\"b\", 2)\n</pre>",
      "translation": "将此键值对放入<a href=\"OutboundRow.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a>并返回自身。此方法适用于在单个表达式中链式调用多个 append 操作：\n\n<pre class=\"code\">row.append(\"a\", 1).append(\"b\", 2)\n</pre>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates an empty <a href=\"OutboundRow.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "创建一个空的<a href=\"OutboundRow.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping 中的类\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Put the given key/value pair into this <a href=\"OutboundRow.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a> and return this.",
      "translation": "将给定的键/值对放入<a href=\"OutboundRow.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping 中的类\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a>中并返回此对象。",
      "count": 2
