    {
      "source": "Representation of a <code>Row</code> to be written through a <code>INSERT</code> or <code>UPDATE</code> statement. Row keys are\nrepresented as <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>SqlIdentifier</code></a>. <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> key names are translated to\n<a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html#unquoted(java.lang.String)\"><code>unquoted identifiers</code></a> when adding or querying for entries.",
      "translation": "表示将通过 <code>INSERT</code> 或 <code>UPDATE</code> 语句写入的 <code>Row</code>。行键表示为 <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>SqlIdentifier</code></a>。在添加或查询条目时，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 键名会被转换为 <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html#unquoted(java.lang.String)\"><code>未加引号的标识符</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
